================================================================
数据归属
================================================================

ERA5 气候数据来自 Copernicus Climate Change Service Climate Data Store。
许可证：Licence to use Copernicus Products v1.2 — 全文见
[licenses/COPERNICUS-LICENSE-v1.2.txt](./licenses/COPERNICUS-LICENSE-v1.2.txt)。

使用时**必须**引用：

  Hersbach, H., Bell, B., Berrisford, P., et al. (2023): ERA5 monthly
  averaged data on single levels from 1940 to present. Copernicus Climate
  Change Service (C3S) Climate Data Store (CDS).
  DOI: https://doi.org/10.24381/cds.f17050d7

Open-Meteo Historical Weather API 是 ERA5 的免费代理服务，按 CC BY 4.0 归属
其官方网站：
  https://open-meteo.com/en/docs/historical-weather-api

详细第三方归属（含 K-Dense Skills、Open-Meteo、CLI-Anything）见
[THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md](./THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md)。
